<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Destrave o Alinhador — Da Insegurança ao Consultório Lucrativo</title>
  <meta name="description" content="O método completo para dentistas avaliarem, cobrarem e venderem alinhadores com segurança. R$147 com acesso imediato." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Destrave o Alinhador — Da Insegurança ao Consultório Lucrativo" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Você fez o credenciamento. Agora aprenda a cobrar R$10.000 por caso com segurança e método." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="pt_BR" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <% if (ga4MeasurementId) { %>
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=<%= ga4MeasurementId %>"></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', '<%= ga4MeasurementId %>');
    </script>
  <% } %>
  <% if (facebookPixelId) { %>
    <script>
    !function(f,b,e,v,n,t,s)
    {if(f.fbq)return;n=f.fbq=function(){n.callMethod?
    n.callMethod.apply(n,arguments):n.queue.push(arguments)};
    if(!f._fbq)f._fbq=n;n.push=n;n.loaded=!0;n.version='2.0';
    n.queue=[];t=b.createElement(e);t.async=!0;
    t.src=v;s=b.getElementsByTagName(e)[0];
    s.parentNode.insertBefore(t,s)}(window, document,'script',
    'https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');
    fbq('init', '<%= facebookPixelId %>');
    fbq('track', 'PageView');
    </script>
    <noscript><img height="1" width="1" style="display:none"
    src="https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=<%= facebookPixelId %>&ev=PageView&noscript=1"
    /></noscript>
  <% } %>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy:   #0f1f3d;
      --blue:   #1a3a6b;
      --accent: #e8a020;
      --gold:   #f5c842;
      --green:  #22c55e;
      --red:    #ef4444;
      --cta:    #e85d04;
      --cta-h:  #c94e03;
      --white:  #ffffff;
      --off:    #f8fafc;
      --text:   #1e293b;
      --muted:  #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --radius: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(15,31,61,.12);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: var(--text); background: var(--white); line-height: 1.6; }

    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }

    /* ── TOP BAR ── */
    .top-bar {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--gold);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      letter-spacing: .4px;
    }
    .top-bar span { color: #fff; }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .lp-header {
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 16px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }
    .lp-logo { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -.5px; }
    .lp-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .header-cta {
      background: var(--cta);
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background .2s;
    }
    .header-cta:hover { background: var(--cta-h); }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, #1a3a6b 60%, #0f2a52 100%);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 72px 24px 60px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(248,200,66,.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(248,200,66,.4);
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }
    .hero h1 em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }
    .hero-price-box {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-price-from { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); text-decoration: line-through; }
    .hero-price-main {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--white);
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 4px 0;
    }
    .hero-price-main sup { font-size: 40%; vertical-align: super; font-weight: 700; }
    .hero-price-or { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); margin: 6px 0 2px; }
    .hero-price-installment { font-size: 15px; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
    .btn-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e85d04, #ff8c00);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 18px 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(232,93,4,.45);
      transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;
      letter-spacing: .3px;
    }
    .btn-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(232,93,4,.55); }
    .btn-cta:active { transform: translateY(0); }
    .hero-trust {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .hero-trust span {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.65);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    .hero-trust span::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── SOCIAL PROOF BAR ── */
    .proof-bar {
      background: var(--off);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 18px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 36px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .proof-item { text-align: center; }
    .proof-num { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1; }
    .proof-label { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    .section { padding: 72px 24px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-full { padding: 72px 24px; }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .section h2 em { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
    .section-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 48px; }

    /* ── PAIN ── */
    .pain-bg { background: #fef9f0; }
    .pain-list { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
    .pain-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid #fde8c4;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .pain-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

    /* ── BRIDGE ── */
    .bridge-bg { background: var(--navy); color: var(--white); }
    .bridge-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: 72px 24px; }
    .bridge-inner h2 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .bridge-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 32px; }
    .bridge-inner .highlight { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── PRODUCT ── */
    .product-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1f3d, #1a3a6b);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px 48px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .product-cover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e5fa8, #0f3a72);
      border-radius: 12px;
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 2px solid rgba(248,200,66,.3);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    }
    .cover-icon { font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .cover-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: .5px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .cover-sub { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); margin-top: 8px; }
    .product-info h3 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .product-info p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .product-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .product-tag {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 100px;
    }

    /* ── BENEFITS ── */
    .benefits-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
    .benefit-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      transition: box-shadow .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .benefit-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .benefit-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .benefit-card h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .benefit-card p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }

    /* ── MODULES ── */
    .modules-bg { background: var(--off); }
    .module-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .module-item {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .module-num {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .module-content h4 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .module-content p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── FOR WHO ── */
    .forwho-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .forwho-col { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px; }
    .forwho-yes { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
    .forwho-no { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
    .forwho-col h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .forwho-yes h3 { color: #15803d; }
    .forwho-no h3 { color: #b91c1c; }
    .forwho-list { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .forwho-list li { font-size: 14px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
    .forwho-yes .forwho-list li::before { content: '✓'; color: #22c55e; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .forwho-no .forwho-list li::before { content: '✗'; color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* ── TESTIMONIALS ── */
    .testimonials-bg { background: var(--off); }
    .testimonials-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
    .testi-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
    }
    .testi-stars { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .testi-text { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 18px; font-style: italic; }
    .testi-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .testi-avatar {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--blue));
      color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .testi-name { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); }
    .testi-role { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── GUARANTEE ── */
    .guarantee-box {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border: 2px solid #86efac;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .guarantee-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .guarantee-box h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #15803d; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .guarantee-box p { color: #166534; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── PRICING ── */
    .pricing-bg { background: var(--navy); }
    .pricing-inner { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: 72px 24px; }
    .pricing-inner h2 { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .pricing-inner .sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 15px; }
    .pricing-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    }
    .pricing-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .pricing-name { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pricing-from { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: line-through; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pricing-price { font-size: 3.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1; margin: 8px 0; }
    .pricing-price sup { font-size: 40%; vertical-align: super; font-weight: 700; }
    .pricing-install { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .pricing-install strong { color: var(--navy); }
    .pricing-includes { text-align: left; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .pricing-includes h4 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .pricing-features { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .pricing-features li { font-size: 14px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; color: var(--text); }
    .pricing-features li::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--green); font-weight: 800; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .pricing-guarantee { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
    .pricing-guarantee strong { color: #15803d; }
    .btn-cta-full {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e85d04, #ff8c00);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(232,93,4,.4);
      transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn-cta-full:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(232,93,4,.5); }

    /* ── FAQ ── */
    .faq-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    details {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    details summary {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 18px 22px;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      user-select: none;
    }
    details summary::after { content: '+'; font-size: 20px; color: var(--muted); }
    details[open] summary::after { content: '−'; }
    details p { padding: 0 22px 18px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── FINAL CTA ── */
    .final-cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, #1a3a6b 100%);
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }
    .final-cta h2 { color: var(--white); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .final-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 36px; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .lp-footer {
      background: #070e1d;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.4);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* ── WHATSAPP FLOAT ── */
    .wa-float {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      background: #25d366;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37,211,102,.5);
      z-index: 999;
      transition: transform .2s;
    }
    .wa-float:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }

    /* ── PULSE ANIMATION ── */
    @keyframes pulse-ring {
      0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(232,93,4,.4); }
      70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(232,93,4,0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(232,93,4,0); }
    }
    .btn-pulse { animation: pulse-ring 2.2s ease-out infinite; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .product-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; padding: 28px 24px; }
      .product-cover { width: 160px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .forwho-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .proof-bar { gap: 20px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .lp-header { padding: 14px 16px; }
      .hero { padding: 48px 16px 40px; }
      .hero-price-box { padding: 20px 24px; }
      .section { padding: 52px 16px; }
      .section-full { padding: 52px 16px; }
    }

    /* ── REVEAL ANIMATION ── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- TOP BAR -->
  <div class="top-bar">
    Lançamento — <span>acesso imediato após a compra</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Garantia incondicional de 7 dias
  </div>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header class="lp-header">
    <div class="lp-logo">Destrave o<span> Alinhador</span></div>
    <a href="#comprar" class="header-cta">Quero o ebook — R$147</a>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Para dentistas credenciados em alinhadores</p>
    <h1>
      Você fez o credenciamento.<br/>
      Agora aprenda a <em>cobrar R$10.000</em><br/>
      por caso com segurança.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      O método completo para avaliar complexidade, definir preço com 85% de margem e apresentar alinhadores de forma que o paciente queira fechar — ainda na consulta.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-price-box">
      <p class="hero-price-from">De R$ 297</p>
      <p class="hero-price-main"><sup>R$</sup>147</p>
      <p class="hero-price-or">ou</p>
      <p class="hero-price-installment">3x de R$49 sem juros</p>
    </div>
    <br/>
    <a href="#comprar" class="btn-cta btn-pulse">Quero destravar meus alinhadores agora</a>
    <div class="hero-trust">
      <span>Acesso imediato</span>
      <span>Garantia de 7 dias</span>
      <span>Pagamento seguro via Hotmart</span>
      <span>100% digital</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF BAR -->
